|lead='''Obi-Wan Kenobi, Padawan Learner''' is a [[Light]] [[Character]] released as a super-rare foil in [[Reflections III]] in October 2001.<ref name="checklist">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Complete Card List v4.0], pp. 28–32 (collecting compilation). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261009184033/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Internet Archive].</ref><ref name="encyc">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2], Reflections product entry (collecting reference). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261008192828/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf Internet Archive].</ref> It is a foil printing of the [[Tatooine]] card.<ref name="foil-face">[[:File:Reflections-III-Foil-L-Obi-Wan-Kenobi-Padawan-Learner-PSA-photo-133075652-original.jpg|Original printed Reflections III foil face]], PSA Set Registry source collection.</ref>
|lore=Qui-Gon Jinn’s Padawan. Stayed behind to protect Queen Amidala when Qui-Gon left to explore Mos Espa, but was in constant communication should he be needed.<ref name="foil-face" />
|game_text=Deploys −2 to Tatooine. If opponent just initiated a battle at a related Tatooine site, may use 2 Force to relocate Obi-Wan to that site. Immune to attrition &lt; 4.<ref name="foil-face" />
